%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#ffffff", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "secondaryColor": "#ffffff", "tertiaryColor": "#ffffff", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#fff3e0", "noteBorderColor": "#e65100"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as **Patient**
    participant S as **System API**
    participant DB as **Main DB**
    actor D as **Doctor**

    Note over P, D: **High-Fidelity Appointment Sequence**

    P->>+S: 📩 Request Appointment (ID, Time)
    
    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        S->>S: Validate Request Security
        S->>+DB: Check Schedule (Prisma/SQLite)
        DB-->>-S: Return Availability Data
    end
    
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        S->>+D: 🔔 Push Notification: "New Pending Request"
    end
    
    Note right of D: Doctor reviews patient history<br/>and local clinic schedule
    
    alt Approval
        D-->>S: ✅ Confirm Appointment
        S->>DB: 💾 Save Persistence (Visits Table)
        S-->>P: 🎉 "Appointment Confirmed" Payload
    else Denied / Error
        D-->>S: ❌ Request Denied / Reschedule
        S-->>P: ⚠️ "Slot Full" or "Retry" Payload
    end
    
    deactivate D
    deactivate S
